<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-SPAIN LEAD GERMANY 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SPAIN LEAD GERMANY 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>MALLORCA, Spain 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain took a 2-0 lead over</p>
<p>Germany after winning both the opening singles in their Davis</p>
<p>Cup World Group first round tie on Friday.</p>
<p>Results (Spanish names first):</p>
<p>Alberto Costa  beat Hendrik Dreekman 6-4 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Carlos Moya beat Marc Goellner 6-4 6-3 6-3</p>
</text>
